{
  "openapi": "3.0.1",
  "info": {
    "title": "ConstLedger API Collection",
    "description": "# ConstLedger API Collection\n\nTwo backends working together:\n\n| Backend | Variable | Responsibility |\n|---------|----------|----------------|\n| Core Backend (port 3000) | `{{coreUrl}}` | Auth, User Management |\n| AI Backend (port 5000) | `{{baseUrl}}` / `{{aiUrl}}` | Contracts, Finance, Reports |\n\n---\n\n## 🔀 Switching Environments\n\nEdit the `env` collection variable to `dev` or `prod` — all URLs update automatically on every request.\n\n| Variable | `dev` | `prod` |\n|----------|-------|--------|\n| `coreUrl` | `http://localhost:3000` | `https://cpms-core--test.mosalem149.deno.net` |\n| `baseUrl` | `http://localhost:5000` | `https://cpms-ai-420306063918.europe-west1.run.app` |\n| `aiUrl` | `http://localhost:5000` | `https://cpms-ai-420306063918.europe-west1.run.app` |\n\n> ⚠️ Never edit `coreUrl`, `baseUrl`, or `aiUrl` directly — they are overwritten automatically. Edit `dev_*` or `prod_*` variables instead.\n\n---\n\n## 👤 User Roles\n\n| Role | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `contract_manager` | Default role |\n| `pmo` | Project Management Office — can create users |\n| `finance_team` | Finance operations |\n| `top_management` | Read-only executive access |\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Quick Start\n\n1. Set `env` to `dev` or `prod` in the **Variables** tab.\n2. Run **POST /api/auth/login** — the test script auto-captures the JWT into `authToken`.\n3. All AI-backend requests automatically attach the cookie via the folder pre-request script.\n\n---\n\n## 🗂 Auto-populated Variables\n\nThese are set automatically by test scripts — no manual input needed:\n\n| Variable | Set by |\n|----------|--------|\n| `authToken` | POST /api/auth/login |\n| `user_id` | POST /api/auth/login · POST /api/users |\n| `contract_id` | POST /api/contracts/upload |\n| `report_id` | POST /api/finance/:contractId/actual |\n| `s3SignedUrl` | POST /api/uploads/sign |\n",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
